# 本地配对凭据与实跑观察值。这些文件可能含真实 deviceId、一次性配对 token
# 和隧道主机名，属于凭据而非源码，绝不能进入公开仓库。
# Local pairing credentials and live-run observations. These may contain a real
# deviceId, a one-time pairing token and a tunnel hostname — credentials, never
# source code. They must not reach a public repository.
.poc-*
.poc-device
.poc-base
.poc-token
tests/.env
*.local.json

